OL,3,AEd Sheeran's next US concerts cancelled
OL,4,Adue to storm warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FEd Sheeran's concerts in Massachusetts
OL,7,Fon Friday and Saturday have been
OL,8,Fcancelled because of severe weather
OL,9,Fwarnings in the area.
OL,11,FThe singer had been scheduled to
OL,12,Fperform two shows at the Gillette
OL,13,FStadium in Foxborough, near Boston, as
OL,14,Fpart of his current US tour.
OL,16,FThe tour has been in the headlines
OL,17,Fbecause of a row over a decision to
OL,18,Fdrop Sheeran's support act Macklemore
OL,19,Ffor making pro-Palestinian comments on
OL,20,Fstage. Stadium owners including the
OL,21,FGillette Stadium's Robert Kraft lobbied
OL,22,Ffor his removal.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
